Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.86,0:21:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,努力
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.73,0:21:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,努力什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.75,0:21:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,明明是接龍苦的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.60,0:21:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不過沒有回報的努力在某種程度來說  也很苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.96,0:21:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,確實沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.91,0:21:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼下一個是Ru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.54,0:21:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.29,0:21:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ru…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.66,0:21:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(640,658)}Rutto sukyatto suru nigami sawa shibu
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.66,0:21:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣幫助人的苦味晴彥
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.60,0:21:47.42,Comment,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.67,0:21:48.62,Comment,,0,0,0,,話說  那是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.33,0:21:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,要努力  把平安夜沒能傳達的愛戀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.76,0:21:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,再次傳達給她
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.57,0:23:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,平安夜的告白我要重新傳達一次
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.61,0:23:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,即使這是為了聲援我的大河
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.88,0:23:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的不行  只會嘴上說說
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.07,0:23:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,已經受夠了
